4"]},"Two main benefits for college students joining the military: up to 20,000 RMB per year for tuition, two-year extension of student status, and a special postgraduate admission program"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Only six scenarios allow the government to assign jobs after discharge; those opting for self-employment must register within 30 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Three key financial aspects after discharge: one-time separation pay, military service counting toward work seniority, and tax deductions for self-employed veterans"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/31-07","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"There’s more than just civil service exams to get into the government system: serving two years in grassroots programs qualifies you for a special recruitment quota of 10% each year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Teachers in the Special Post Program who complete three years of service, pass evaluations, and wish to stay should be promptly added to the official teaching staff"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Firefighters and civilian personnel in the military represent two additional pathways for public recruitment, with lower entry requirements than civil service exams"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Education is not a one-time deal: self-study exams have no age or prior education limits; both adult college entrance exams and open universities offer pathways to further education"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Not joining a company means you must arrange your own social insurance: you’ll need to enroll in pension and medical plans at your place of work, as household registration restrictions have now been lifted"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Food delivery workers, ride‑hailing drivers, and local freight carriers all get occupational injury coverage paid for by the platform on a per‑order basis — at no cost to them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Two pathways to secure a government job on the day you fill out college applications: government-funded teacher training and targeted medical student programs, at the cost of a six-year service commitment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Before going abroad to work, check whether the company has a license for international labor cooperation: it is illegal for them to demand a deposit from you"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Working remotely for a foreign company from home: this income is considered domestic earnings for tax purposes; you must file your own individual income tax returns, and incoming payments should be reported as “employee compensation”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Starting a business without joining a company? First look at startup guarantee loans: up to 300,000 RMB per individual, with the government covering half the interest"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/31"},"children":["Chapter 31"," ·"," ","What options are available after turning 18?"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"31-07"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["07"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["There’s more than just civil service exams to get into the government system: serving two years in grassroots programs qualifies you for a special recruitment quota of 10% each year"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Getting into the government system isn’t limited to taking civil service exams. After completing two years of satisfactory service in programs such as “Three Supports and One Assistance,” you become eligible for a special recruitment pool that accounts for roughly 10% of each year’s civil service openings. Those who take the postgraduate entrance exam within three years also get an extra 10 points added to their total score. The catch is that you’ll be paid only a government stipend during those two years."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no upfront cost. The trade‑off is spending two yea…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The fourth round of the “Three Supports and One Assistance” program states that the service term is two years.…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: There’s more than just civil service exams to get into the government system: serving two years in grassroots programs qualifies you for a special recruitment quota of 10% each year"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There’s no upfront cost. The trade‑off is spending two years working at a grassroots level in a township. During those two years you receive a government stipend rather than a market‑rate salary, and you must be prepared to endure that period."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The fourth round of the “Three Supports and One Assistance” program states that the service term is two years. It also specifies that each province must reserve about 10% of its civil service recruitment slots for participants in this and similar grassroots programs. Additionally, local governments are required to set aside a certain number of positions in county‑ and township‑level public institutions for those who have completed the program and passed the evaluation; once hired, they are exempt from a probationary period. This means these spots are open only to former participants, not to outsiders. The same notice adds that anyone who finishes the program and meets the criteria can receive a 10‑point boost on their postgraduate exam score and be given priority admission under equal conditions. Graduates from vocational colleges who meet the requirements may also be admitted to undergraduate programs without taking further exams. Moreover, those without prior work experience who complete the program can enjoy the same rights as fresh graduates for two years in terms of civil service and corporate hiring, entrepreneurship, household registration, and further education; their service time counts as work seniority, with the start date being the day they reported to the grassroots post. Financial support from the central government is 30,000 yuan per person per year for western regions, 24,000 yuan for central regions, and 12,000 yuan for eastern regions. A joint directive from the General Offices of the CPC Central Committee and the State Council states that such individuals may enjoy the same treatment as fresh graduates for two years after completing the program, and that most senior posts in central government agencies must be filled by candidates with at least two years of grassroots experience. Another pathway is the Western China Program, jointly organized by the Central Committee of the Communist Youth League, the Ministry of Education, the Ministry of Finance, and the Ministry of Human Resources and Social Security; it recruits recent university graduates and postgraduate students to provide volunteer services in western grassroots areas for one to three years."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["中共中央组织部、人力资源社会保障部等十部门 (2021). 关于实施第四轮高校毕业生「三支一扶」计划的通知（人社部发〔2021〕32 号，第七、八、九、十一、十二、十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-06/04/content_5615404.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-06/04/content_5615404.htm"]},"；中共中央办公厅、国务院办公厅 (2017). 关于进一步引导和鼓励高校毕业生到基层工作的意见（第五、十六、十八条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2017/content_5171278.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2017/content_5171278.htm"]},"；全国大学生志愿服务西部计划项目管理办公室 (2026). 2026—2027 年度大学生志愿服务西部计划招募协议书. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://xibu.youth.cn/tzgg/202604/t20260423_16623558.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://xibu.youth.cn/tzgg/202604/t20260423_16623558.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-06/04/content_5615404.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["The fourth round of the “Three Supports and One Assistance” program covers the years 2021‑2025. No fifth‑round documents or 2026 notices have been found yet, so be sure to check the latest recruitment announcements before applying. In 2025 the central government funded the recruitment of 34,430 participants. The full implementation plan for the Western China Program is not publicly available, and the relevant policy page on its official site cannot be accessed. Benefits for graduates of that program are governed by the same CPC‑State Council directive applicable to all grassroots programs. Keep in mind that you must actually serve the full two years under a government stipend; don’t focus solely on the subsequent special recruitment opportunities."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/31-06"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["Previous"]},"Three key financial aspects after discharge: one-time separation pay, military service counting toward work seniority, and tax deduct